-- 登记: D5-ctl-sctn-free | 语义: 把那根没有关节的型钢的终点写回 W 175 N 0 D 40
-- expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 joint/ctl_sctn_free_apply.mac 的 restore | 库: db8000
-- 写的是绝对值，重跑幂等。期望与 apply 对称：只重建 SFREE 一件。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-CTL-SCTN-FREE-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-C-SFREE
Q REF
Q NAME
Q TYPE
Q POSS
Q POSE
POSE E -175 N 0 U -40
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-C-F1-S1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-PJ-C-F1-N1-J1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q CREF
Q POS WRT /*
Q ORI WRT /*
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite T2 joint/ctl_sctn_free restore: unjointed SCTN POSE -> W 175'
$P SUITE-T2-JOINT-CTL-SCTN-FREE-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
